Rāma offers ghee to Nārāyaṇa with Sītā --- Rāma sleeps on kuśa bed with Vaidēhī --- Rāma wakes and decorates house --- Rāma prays as Brāhmaṇas bless amid drums --- Citizens raise flags, strew flowers, light lamps --- People sing crowning tales --- Children tell crowning tales at doors --- Crowds praise Daśaratha and Rāma --- Jānapadas fill noisy city like sea
